     6	
     7	## Scope and unchanged behavior
     8	
     9	This is a language change. D162 is finished and failed; its two-step experiment is not promoted. Do not fix event identity, admission, grouping semantics, or judgement policy as part of translation. No paid model run is authorized by this implementation plan. Existing tests and stored-answer replay establish code compatibility, not English extraction quality.
