   148	def round_of_judgements(archive, cfg, conn, changed_views, seq, item, *, transport=None):
   149	    """Judge the open views in changed_views, dependencies first; a changed conclusion queues open dependants.
   150	
   151	    Views that do not depend on each other are judged at the same time: each level of the dependency order is sent
   152	    to the model concurrently (the prompts are built and the answers checked and written in this thread, so the
   153	    database connection never crosses threads). A view waits while anything upstream of it is still pending, so a
   154	    dependant always reads this round's conclusion of its dependency. A view with no evidence in force stays
   155	    还没判 (D59), and a view already judged at this sequence number (a resumed round) is not judged twice."""
